	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><persName ref="p179">Hermannus Aquilomontanus</persName> d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName> s[alutem] d[icit].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Epistolam<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11507">Nr. 1464</ref>.</note> tuam piam et eruditam pastoralem admonitionem continentem d. <persName ref="p18147">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Bekesteyn</persName> fidelis in domino tradidit, in qua non modo <placeName ref="l803">Tigurine</placeName> ecclesie sollicitudinem, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sed omnium ecclesiarum curam te gerere ostendis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Gavisi sunt fratres pii literis tuis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>lectis et communi voce gratias agunt, precantur in te spiritus augmentum et crescentiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Satis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>calamo indicare nec voce humana eloqui potest, quantas sectas hic apud <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nos inter simplices anabaptistas suscitat<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> suscitat <hi>gestrichenes</hi> hic.</note> sathan, ut non mirum paucos<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Vor</hi> paucos <hi>gestrichenes</hi> s.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>salvari.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ii nullos admittunt doctores nisi retinctos, omnes ministros <persName ref="p6901">Vatiniano</persName><note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>In der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> Vatidiano.</note><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p6901">Publius Vatinius</persName>, ca. 95-42 v. Chr., ein prominenter Gefolgsmann <persName ref="p4491">Caesars</persName>, war Konsul des Jahres 47 v. Chr. Vor allem <persName ref="p4543">Cicero</persName> attackierte ihn scharf; der Hass gegen <persName ref="p6901">Vatimus</persName> wurde durch <persName ref="p18839">Catull</persName> (Carm. 14, 3) sprichwörtlich (Adagia, 2, 2, 94, <bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 481). - Lit.: Pauly/Wissowa, 2. Reihe, 15. Halbbd. (VIII A, 1), Sp. 495-520.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>odio prosequuntur; quidam mallent gladio cervicem praebere quam templum intrare, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>alii in pluralitate uxorum sanctimoniam statuunt,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die Rede ist wohl von Anhängern von <persName ref="p5382">David Joris</persName> oder von <placeName ref="l1097">münsterischen</placeName> Täufern (vgl. <hi>Doornkaat Koolman,</hi> aaO, S. 89).</note> alii alterius secte hominem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>necare sacrificium putant<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint sind vermutlich Anhänger von <persName ref="p7341">Jan van Batenburg</persName> (vgl. <hi>Doornkaat Koolman,</hi> ebd.).</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">In quod seculum incidimus, charissime frater?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>accedunt magni nominis doctores<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint sind die im erwähnten Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> kritisierten Fürsprecher einer nikodemitischen Haltung.</note> sub omni cubito pulvinariam consternentes<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ez 13, 18</ref></cit>.</note>, ut <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>crux Christi evacuetur<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 1, 17</ref></cit>.</note>, docentes posse duobus dominis servire<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 24</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 16, 13</ref></cit>.</note> verbum domini era<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>dentes: „Qui vult sequi post me, ferat crucem suam indies“ [Mt 16, 24 par.] etc., „nolite <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mirari, si odit vos mundus“ <cit type="bible"><ref>[1Joh 3, 13]</ref></cit> etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Stulti sancti martyres fuere (ut vere inquis<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Oben <ref target="file11507">Nr. 1464</ref>, 78-81.</note>), <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>stultus fuit Eleazarus senex apud Machabeos, qui ob buccellam carnis boville <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>simulate vitam eripere noluit<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Makk 6, 18-31</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Mirari satis nequeo, frater amabilis, tantos <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>viros huiusmodi cecitate teneri, quasi Christus nunc<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">nunc <hi>anstelle von gestrichenem</hi> hic <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> absque cruce praeter morem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>maiorum inveniri posset.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Non invenitur in terris absque cruce, post hanc <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vitam cum illo gloriabimur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed dominus hisce pravis doctrinis nos admonet, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ne<pb type="edition" next="297"/> hominibus nos demus, sed deo, qui est unicus magister fidelium.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed desino<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Nach</hi> desino <hi>ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note>, scien<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>s, cui scribam, nempe a quo totis praecordiis discere cupio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Binas modo <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>literas a te accepi<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Vor</hi> accepi <hi>gestrichenes</hi> s.</note>, virorum doctissime, in quarum prima<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Nicht erhalten.</note> pastorem plene instituis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>docesque, quid me facere oporteat; in altera<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vgl. Anm.1.</note> per <persName ref="p18147">Io. Bekensteyn</persName> oblata <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>paterne mones, ne movear cum pluribus magnorum ampullis et ne simplices <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>pravum errorem sequi patiar.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Apud <placeName ref="l20">Hollandos</placeName> meos et hic apud <placeName ref="l734">Phri<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>sones</placeName> agam quam possum, tuam epistolam divulgabo, interim orabo dominum, sue cause <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>adsit.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ad primam epistolam nundinis praeteritis<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Zum Termin der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Frühjahrsmesse s. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10812">[Nr. 774]</ref>, S. 193, Anm. 18.</note> per mercatorem<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>Endung undeutlich korrigiert (vielleicht eher als</hi> mercatores <hi>zu lesen, was jedoch nicht zur Fortsetzung des Satzes passt).</hi></note> <placeName ref="l1097">Monasterien[sem]</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>paucis respondi,<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Ein entsprechendes Schreiben ist nicht erhalten.</note> sed cum is non redeat, vereor scriptum intercidisse; desiderabam <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>optimum modum tractandi anabaptistas, inter quos vivo, qui non modo contiones <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>spernunt, sed simplices, ne audiant, retrahunt, patientiam nostram rident,<pb type="scan" next="1380v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>sacra nostra ad Christi normam instituta abominantur, et si aliquando nos audiant, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>in sacris vero alienant se longissime.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">In congressu plura promittunt, sed <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nil praestant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Nunc rursum se movent Capernaite<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">D. h. die Anhänger eines sinnlich-fleischlichen Verständnisses der Gegenwart von Leib und Blut Christi im Abendmahl (nach Joh 6, 52 [Vulg. 53]); gemeint sind die Lutheraner. Vgl. Hans <hi>Jorissen,</hi> Art. Kapharnaitismus, in: LThK<hi rend="sup">3</hi> V 1210f.</note>, novi papiste cum sua <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>carnali praesentia in verba <persName ref="p1974">magistri</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">D. h. <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName>.</note> coniurati.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Hosce non prolixis disputationibus, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sed succinctis ac firmis aphorismis pungere statui, quoniam<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h">quoniam <hi>anstelle von gestrichenem</hi> etiam <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note>, si vincantur, victoriam <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>sibi usurpant, tandem se nolle aliud sentire quam docti illi proclamant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Vos omnes, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>queso, optimi viri, pro nobis orate, dominus nos indies magis illuminet et in veritate <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>confortet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Libellos tuos De autoritate scripture et episcopali functione<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, De scripturae sanctae authoritate [...]deque episcoporum [...]institutione et functione [...], <placeName ref="l803">Zürich</placeName> (<persName ref="p4851">Christoph Froschauer</persName>) 1538 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 111).</note>, De origine erroris <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>locupletatum<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> locuplatum.</note><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Zur Neubearbeitung von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> "De origine erroris", die 1539 in <placeName ref="l803">Zürich</placeName> erschien (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 112), vgl. <bibl source="b11">HBBW IX</bibl> <ref target="file11280">[Nr. 1237]</ref>, S. 78, Anm. 7.</note> lego et saturari nequeo; omnigenam eruditionem variamque lectionem, <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>studium indefessum admiror candoremque in omnibus exosculor.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si quid post illos <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>emiseris in utilitatem ecclesie, scire desidero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Hisce paucis vale cum tuis commi<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>litonibus, quos omnes omnium fratrum nomine diligenter salutabis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat vos <persName ref="p18147">Ioannes <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Bekesteyn</persName>, qui inter summa dona dei numerat vestram fraternitatem ac ordinem <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>vidisse.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Conservet vos in bono et patientes reddat optimus maximus; in oratione humili <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>et longanimi<pb type="edition" next="298"/><note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> loganimi.</note> patientia christianorum vitam iudico.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete, optimi viri, et sponse <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Christi<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">D. h. der Kirche.</note> vos esse custodes nunquam obliviscamini.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Alias latius ac tersius me <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>scripturum confido; hanc temporis angustia conscribere, non dictare coegit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/><placeName ref="l138">Emde</placeName>, 20. augusti anno 1541.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Pio et docto viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l803">Tigurine</placeName> ecclesie <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>pastori vigilantissimo, praeceptori <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
